"document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521206004:0":{"text":"해치... 해치웠다니...","source_cn":"消灭……消灭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9EC18504EDC6191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521206005:0":{"text":"네. 당신을 구하고 싶지만 문이 잠겨 있네요.","source_cn":"是的。我们要救你出来，但是门被锁住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FDE7B8BAD0220A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521206006:0":{"text":"열 방법은 없나요?","source_cn":"你有办法打开它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF77347C7D1BE99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521206007:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog107>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A02CBBA31401134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521206008:0":{"text":"괜...찮으세요?","source_cn":"你……你还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98BEA5E40B81E9EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521206009:0":{"text":"...네.","source_cn":"……我在。<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA16AD98C035E301F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521206010:0":{"text":"문이... 잠겨있어요. 가시 메뚜기를 피하려고 저희가 잠갔거든요.","source_cn":"门……门上锁了。我们要躲起来，避免被针蝗发现，所以锁住了门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63EAAC24B6861A6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521206011:1":{"text":"그런데... 열쇠가... <style=\"highlight\">열쇠가 사라졌어요</style>.","source_cn":"那之后，钥匙……<style=highlight>钥匙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EF15AB3AA4736FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1521206011":{"text":"그런데... 열쇠가... <style=\"highlight\">열쇠가 사라졌어요</style>.","source_cn":"那之后，钥匙……<style=highlight>钥匙不见了</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EF15AB3AA4736FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521206012:0":{"text":"아뇨, 이젠 저뿐이에요...","source_cn":"他们不在了。只有我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1FA1208543010A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521206013:0":{"text":"다들 버티지 못해서 이젠 저뿐이에요..","source_cn":"他们坚持不下去，只有我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290EF0105285958D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"“저희”? 안에 다른 사람도 있어?","source_cn":"“你们”？屋里还有其他人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF979B2598C94B046","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"“저희”? 안에 다른 사람도 있어?","female":"“저희”? 안에 다른 사람도 있어?","variant_male_record_index":"78221","variant_female_record_index":"78222","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521206014:0":{"text":"아뇨, 못 찾아요. 다른 사람들이 어디에 뒀는지 모르거든요.","source_cn":"不，我找不到。我不知道他们放在哪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE62BDE96DAA058DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521206015:0":{"text":"아뇨... 원래는 알았어요. <style=\"highlight\">제가 못 찾게 된 것뿐이에요</style>.","source_cn":"不……我原本知道，<style=highlight>是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08398C39E49D1F6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521206016:0":{"text":"...말이 이상해요.","source_cn":"……他说话好奇怪。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC91FC3BCACFE37FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...말이 이상해요.","female":"...말이 이상해요.","variant_male_record_index":"184085","variant_female_record_index":"184086","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"열쇠가 안에 있을 테니 어서 찾아봐","source_cn":"钥匙肯定还在屋里，快找找","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x847307776DA92242","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"열쇠가 안에 있을 테니 어서 찾아봐","female":"열쇠가 안에 있을 테니 어서 찾아봐","variant_male_record_index":"78223","variant_female_record_index":"78224","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521206017:2":{"text":"아뇨... 전 이 마을 사람이 아니에요.","source_cn":"不……我不是这个村子的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC48A168602C35E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521206018:0":{"text":"저는... <style=\"highlight\">안톤</style>이라고 하는 보칼리스인이에요. <style=\"highlight\">도시를 지키던 병사였죠</style>.","source_cn":"我叫……叫<style=highlight>安东</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8983173EE479578B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521206019:0":{"text":"가시 메뚜기가 처음 나타났을 때, 저희 소대는 가시 메뚜기를 처치하려고 여기로 파견됐어요.","source_cn":"针蝗刚出现时，我们小队被派到这里……处理它们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DCBDD64E476BD97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521206020:0":{"text":"그런데 가시 메뚜기가 너무 많고 몬스터도 있어서... 이 집에 숨었고 아무도 도망치지 못했어요.","source_cn":"可是针蝗数量太多，还有怪物……我们躲在屋子里，没人逃得出去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B9F54DD41A3C181","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521206021:0":{"text":"<sad>그리고 이제는 저 혼자 남았네요...</sad>","source_cn":"<sad>到现在，只剩下我了……</sad>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B810F46F1D0C5C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1521206021":{"text":"<sad>그리고 이제는 저 혼자 남았네요...</sad>","source_cn":"<sad>到现在，只剩下我了……</sad>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B810F46F1D0C5C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521206022:0":{"text":"네. 보칼리스인이 아쿠보르를 공격한 것도 오래된 일이에요.","source_cn":"是的。呼临人进攻雅库伯尔也很久了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB1B5A820D2F08A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521206023:1":{"text":"그때부터 지금까지... 뭔가 먹었나요?","source_cn":"你从那时候，坚持到了现在……吃什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5897AC7E53676011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521206024:0":{"text":"모, 모르겠어요...","source_cn":"我……我不知道……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D752C9D8C20752C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1521206025:1":{"text":"...가시 메뚜기?\n네, 가시 메뚜기요... 전부 가시 메뚜기였어요!","source_cn":"……针蝗？\\n对，针蝗……全都是针蝗！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA32E2443EA1C3D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521206026:0":{"text":"어쩔 수 없었어요... 어쩔 수 없었다고요! 너무 배가 고팠단 말이에요!","source_cn":"我没有办法……我没有办法！我好饿，我真的好饿！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B2DE8BB27093EB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521206027:0":{"text":"고기도 물도 없고, 가시 메뚜기만 있어서... 가시 메뚜기를 먹을 수밖에 없었어요!","source_cn":"没有肉，没有水，只有针蝗……我们只能吃针蝗！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D03712F4CE2D36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521206028:0":{"text":"하지만 가시 메뚜기를 먹은 뒤로 몸 상태가 점점 나빠져서 검을 뽑을 힘도 남지 않았고...","source_cn":"可是吃了针蝗以后，所有人的身体都越来越差，拔剑的力气也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92D7D7D5A1A8C608","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521206029:1":{"text":"...그건 사람이 먹을 게 아니에요. 얼른 도망쳐요!\n가시 메뚜기가 다시 오기 전에 어서요!","source_cn":"——那东西不是人吃的！快逃，快逃！！\\n趁着针蝗还没来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEB9EC017EDE36D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:35:1521206029":{"text":"...그건 사람이 먹을 게 아니에요. 얼른 도망쳐요!\n가시 메뚜기가 다시 오기 전에 어서요!","source_cn":"——那东西不是人吃的！快逃，快逃！！\\n趁着蝗虫还没来！快逃！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEB9